  <!-- Ported by src/RimMandrake/Utils/donor_pack_port.py port (DONOR_DEFS_PORT_TO_OURS_1, batch W2a) from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection (MIT; workshop 3497316713, 1.6/Defs). Donor-only names renamed RSW_; values verbatim. A texPath under swanimals/ or swresource/ keeps the donor path; its PNGs are extracted donor art installed in SWBestiary/Textures through the art ledger (owner 2026-10-14: ports may re-use extracted donor art until we regenerate). Our own patches that targeted the donor defName were applied BEFORE the rename (so this is the creature the game showed): src/RimStarWars/SWBestiary/Patches/BeastNorm/BeastNorm_Law3.xml (8 ops), src/RimStarWars/SWBestiary/Patches/Tauntaun_CanonArt.xml (4 ops), src/RimUtinni/UtinniPatches/Patches/BiomeCastEvictions_WildBiomes.xml (8 ops), src/RimUtinni/UtinniPatches/Patches/Vapaad_BlueDesertArt.xml (4 ops). Those patch ops still name the donor and go dead when it is retired. Support defs reached from the batch's species. -->
